{
  "_note": "TEMPORARY, AI-GENERATED, NOT HUMAN-MAINTAINED. Delete tests/e2e/ when the stateless migration (#1128) closes. Pins the v1 protocol surface across the migration with real per-case assertions; not a permanent suite, not in CI. `\"configs\": [\"__all__\"]` runs a case against every configuration. See tests/e2e/README.md.",
  "configs": {
    "default": {},
